    "title": "Bay City woman charged with stealing upwards of $43,000 from disabled father - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Cole Waterman ,\n8 hours ago BAY CITY, MI — A Bay City woman is accused of stealing a five-figure sum from her disabled father, money she claimed went to paying off her mountain of debt. Valerielynn A. “Valerie” Mounts, 39, is charged with larceny between $1,000 and $20,000 and ATM fraud between $1,000 and $20,000. Both charges are felonies punishable by up to five years in prison and a fine of $10,000 or three times the amount stolen. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 11",
